# --- submission packaging lives outside this workbench ---
# Ignore local capsule / portal worktrees if present beside the clone.
# /submission/ (2026-08-09 dual-plane) hid Plane-C / PeerJ capsule dumps
# dropped at repo root. The house pack now occupies submission/ and must
# stay trackable (README, default-article sources, submit-* pointers,
# locks/, checklists/, figures/). Old PeerJ/flat dumps remain ignored
# via the paths below. LaTeX junk is already covered by the global
# *.aux/*.log/*.out/*.bbl/*.blg/*.synctex.gz rules.
/paper/
/manuscript/
/submission_flat/
/peerj_workspace/
/submission_figures/
submission/default-article/paper.pdf
Rplots.pdf
.omc/
.omx/
.claude/worktrees/
